1200 BM$="Susanna: David! Are you okay?!":GOSUB 5100
1210 BM$="Susanna saw the blood staining David's shirt, but there was no actual\blade piercing him.":GOSUB 5100
1220 BM$="Susanna: It's a northern curse...! Hang in there, David!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
